# Delney, Streetwise Lookout: "Creatures you control with power 2 or less can't be blocked by creatures with power 3 or
# greater" (CR 509.1b). Delney (2/2) and Tersa Lightshatter (3/3) attack Bot2, who has Hero of Bladehold (3/4) and an
# Elvish Mystic (1/1): the Hero may not block Delney, but may block Tersa (a 3-power attacker), and the Mystic may block
# Delney. Tersa and the Hero trade 3 damage each - Tersa dies, the Hero lives - and Delney kills the Mystic.
# Bot1: turn 1 Delney (Plains, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet) and Mox Ruby; turn 3 Tersa (Ruby, Plains, Pearl), discarding nothing,
# and the attack. Bot2: turn 2 the Hero (Black Lotus WWW and a Plains) and the Mystic (Mox Emerald).

